<title>USA: Chiquita cuts Smithfield stake.</title>
<headline>Chiquita cuts Smithfield stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chiquita Brands International Inc said on Tuesday it reduced its stake in Smithfield Foods Inc to 3.3 percent, or 601,573 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Chiquita said it sold 492,700 shares of Smithfield in a registered offering berween August 23 and September 9 at prices ranging from $27.69 to $29.00 a share.</p>
